  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 4.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started. Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.56,
      "end_seconds": 15.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, I've been feeling low most days. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.72,
      "end_seconds": 17.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.16,
      "end_seconds": 36.6,
      "duration_seconds": 17.44,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many. Oh, um, and no interest in things. That's been about the the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.35,
      "end_seconds": 42.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "have you been feeling low most days at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.39,
      "end_seconds": 52.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.81,
      "end_seconds": 66.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Has there been any panic attacks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.34,
      "end_seconds": 70.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "nope, um, no panic attacks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.52,
      "end_seconds": 77.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Have you had any hearing voices, drinking more or thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.74,
      "end_seconds": 82.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.39,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.08,
      "end_seconds": 90.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 97.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.69,
      "end_seconds": 106.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "I've had low haemoglobin, yes. I've had arthritis in my knees, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.34,
      "end_seconds": 108.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.63,
      "end_seconds": 127.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.8,
      "end_seconds": 131.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.4,
      "end_seconds": 135.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.97,
      "end_seconds": 139.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Amoxicillin. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.05,
      "end_seconds": 143.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.76,
      "end_seconds": 150.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day. I take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.11,
      "end_seconds": 154.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.02,
      "end_seconds": 170.98,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 172.25,
      "end_seconds": 179.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 86, blood pressure 121 over 74, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.67,
      "end_seconds": 181.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.18,
      "end_seconds": 186.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.02,
      "end_seconds": 197.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.49,
      "end_seconds": 201.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.24,
      "end_seconds": 215.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "You are tearful and speaking slowly, but you are following everything well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.19,
      "end_seconds": 226.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "you can relax now okay, thinking it through, the most likely explanation is a moderate depressive episode we shouldn't forget an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.21,
      "end_seconds": 231.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "What are the the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.47,
      "end_seconds": 256.17,
      "duration_seconds": 22.7,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a moderate depressive episode, and we'll know more once the a thyroid test is back. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've been feeling low most days, and no drinking more or thoughts of harming myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.83,
      "end_seconds": 258.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "correct"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.69,
      "end_seconds": 289.34,
      "duration_seconds": 29.65,
      "text": "let's get a thyroid test, for low mood. Let's get a blood count, for tiredness. I'd like you to take sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day in the morning, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for low mood. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Try a short walk each day and keep a regular sleep routine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.06,
      "end_seconds": 302.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "Come back or go to emergency straight away if you have thoughts of harming yourself. Come back in two weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.29,
      "end_seconds": 308.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.28,
      "end_seconds": 311.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Alright, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}